<li>
<p>understand transfer functions;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>connect state-space and transfer-function representations;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand poles and zeros;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize stability from poles;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand asymptotic, Lyapunov, and exponential stability;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>analyze stability using eigenvalues;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize marginal stability;</p>
</li>
<li>
