<li>
<p>understand integral control;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand derivative control;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>formulate PID control;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand steady-state error;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize overshoot, rise time, settling time, and damping;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand characteristic equations;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand root-locus ideas conceptually;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize frequency response;</p>
